WEBVTT

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:05.588
(drumroll)

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:09.426
(fanfare playing)

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.104
(music ends)

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.198
(sniffing)

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.287
(wind whistling softly)

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.205
(sniffing continues)

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:46.337
♪ ♪
冰川时代 3

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:47.255
(loud whimper)
冰川时代 3

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:51.009
(sniffing)
冰川时代 3

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:52.552
(gasps)

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:55.055
(whines)

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:57.891
(gasps)

00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:01.227
(grunting, panting)

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.104
(gasps)

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.314
(screams)

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.315
(sniffing)

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.275
(brief rustling)

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:09.110
(goofy grunt)

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:11.321
(sniffing)

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.447
(gasps)

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.990
(sniffing)

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:17.243
(gasps)

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:22.415
(funky music)

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.709
♪ You'll never find ♪

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:29.839
-(squeaky sigh)
-♪ As long as you live ♪

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.174
♪ Someone who ♪

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.051
-(deep, moaning sigh)
-♪ Loves you ♪

00:01:33.134 --> 00:01:34.052
(thud)

00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:36.221
♪ Tender like I do ♪

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.472
(moaning sigh)

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.810
♪ You'll never find ♪

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:43.144
-(gasps)
-(music stops abruptly)

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:44.437
(panting)

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.480
(grunts)

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:49.526
(strained grunting)

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.154
(grunts)

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:54.864
(angry muttering)

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.325
(squeaky whining)

00:01:57.408 --> 00:01:59.702
(continues whining)

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:01.538
(gulps)

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.498
(sniffing)

00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:05.583
(whining)

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.254
(squeaky crying)

00:02:09.337 --> 00:02:10.588
(exhales sharply)

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:11.881
Hmm?

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.925
(squeaky gasp, sniffing)

00:02:15.343 --> 00:02:17.303
(quiet grunt)

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:19.139
(squeaky grunting)

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:20.473
(both grunting)

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:22.725
(squeaking, grunting)

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:24.310
(screaming)

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:25.603
(scream fading in distance)

00:02:25.687 --> 00:02:27.021
(goofy grunt)

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.232
(distant yelping)

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.526
(echoing yell)

00:02:31.609 --> 00:02:33.528
(deep whooshing)

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:36.156
(whimpering)

00:02:36.239 --> 00:02:37.574
(grunts)

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:38.575
(whimpering)

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.452
-(whimpering, gasping)
-(grunting)

00:02:41.536 --> 00:02:42.370
(song resumes)

00:02:42.453 --> 00:02:43.955
(relieved groan)

00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:47.500
-(sighs sweetly)
-♪ You'll never find ♪

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:51.004
♪ It'll take the end of all time ♪

00:02:51.087 --> 00:02:52.505
(needle scratches record, music stops)

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:53.756
(clucks tongue mockingly)

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:57.010
(loud whimper)

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:58.553
(squeaky gasp)

00:02:58.636 --> 00:03:00.597
(screams)

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.600
(frantic grunting)

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:06.311
(screaming)

00:03:08.062 --> 00:03:09.647
(thud, grunt)

00:03:10.106 --> 00:03:12.483
(groaning)

00:03:14.485 --> 00:03:16.237
(rumbling)
快生了！

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:17.322
It's happening!
快生了！

00:03:17.405 --> 00:03:19.407
(groans, grunts angrily)
快生了！

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.951
(yelping)

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:22.994
SID:
Wait up, guys.
大家等我啊！

00:03:23.077 --> 00:03:24.037
(pained grunting)
大家等我啊！

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.246
(gasps)

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.541
(screaming, whimpering)

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:30.335
(yells)

00:03:30.418 --> 00:03:32.545
(panting)
The baby's coming!
宝宝要出生了！

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:33.838
-The baby's coming!
-Hey, watch it!
宝宝要出生了！

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:34.797
I'm having a baby!
-看！
-我要有宝宝了！

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.341
Code blue! Code blue!
-蓝色警戒！
-要是女生就是粉红色！

00:03:36.424 --> 00:03:38.593
Or pink-- if it's a girl.
-蓝色警戒！
-要是女生就是粉红色！

00:03:38.676 --> 00:03:40.678
Having a baby, having a baby.
I'm coming, Ellie!
生宝宝了！艾莉 我来了！

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:41.888
(grunts)
生宝宝了！艾莉 我来了！

00:03:41.971 --> 00:03:43.431
We got it!
接住了！

00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:45.391
(grunting)

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:46.392
Whoa!

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:48.353
Ah, ah... oh.

00:03:48.436 --> 00:03:49.437
(sighs)

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:50.521
(Sid shouting in distance)

00:03:50.605 --> 00:03:52.440
Ow, ow, ow!

00:03:52.523 --> 00:03:53.566
Ow!

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.235
(grunting)

00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:56.611
-(thud)
-SID: Ow!

00:03:57.487 --> 00:03:58.488
Ellie, Ellie!
艾莉！

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.448
Oh... Ellie, where are you?
艾莉 你在哪里？我在哪里？

00:04:00.531 --> 00:04:02.283
Whoa, Ellie, where am I?
艾莉 你在哪里？我在哪里？

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:03.326
-Manny.
-Huh?
曼尼？

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.203
-(pained sigh)
-ELLIE: I told you,
曼尼？

00:04:05.286 --> 00:04:07.080
it was just a kick.
我说了 宝宝只是踢了一下

00:04:07.163 --> 00:04:08.957
(Crash and Eddie groaning, sighing)

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.376
Oh, right, right.
哦！对喔！

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:13.461
(relieved sigh)
Wow.
哦！对喔！

00:04:13.544 --> 00:04:16.673
Ah, you really gave Daddy a scare.
你把爸爸吓坏了！爸爸在发神经！

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.299
Daddy got silly.
你把爸爸吓坏了！爸爸在发神经！

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:21.594
Daddy fall down cliff
and go boom, boom, boom, boom.
爸爸摔下悬崖 砰、砰、砰

00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:23.513
(giggles)
Silly Daddy.
爸爸好笨

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.056
Yeah...
爸爸好笨

00:04:25.139 --> 00:04:26.432
(chuckles)

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.434
Uh...

00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:29.894
sorry, folks.
抱歉 虚惊！宝宝只是踢了一下！

00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:31.271
False alarm.
抱歉 虚惊！宝宝只是踢了一下！

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:32.647
It was just a kick.
抱歉 虚惊！宝宝只是踢了一下！

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:33.856
(disappointed groans)

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.108
You know who I'd like to kick?
-你知道我想踢谁吗？
-这礼拜已经虚惊三次了

00:04:35.191 --> 00:04:37.402
That's the third false alarm this week.
-你知道我想踢谁吗？
-这礼拜已经虚惊三次了

00:04:37.485 --> 00:04:38.861
All right, show's over.
好了 结束了 大家散了吧！

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.155
Break it up. Break it up.
好了 结束了 大家散了吧！

00:04:41.239 --> 00:04:44.284
Oh, I see someone else
who has a bun in the oven.
有人也怀孕啰！

00:04:44.367 --> 00:04:46.369
(grunts angrily)
I'm not pregnant!
我没怀孕！

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:47.620
Ow!
我没怀孕！

00:04:47.704 --> 00:04:48.871
It's too bad.
太可惜了 你一定是好妈妈！

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.498
You'd make a wonderful mother.
太可惜了 你一定是好妈妈！

00:04:50.581 --> 00:04:51.916
Ow!
太可惜了 你一定是好妈妈！

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.668
Manny, I know you're excited.
曼尼 我知道你很兴奋 我也是
不过你有点兴奋过头了

00:04:53.751 --> 00:04:55.128
I am, too.
曼尼 我知道你很兴奋 我也是
不过你有点兴奋过头了

00:04:55.211 --> 00:04:57.046
But you're getting a little carried away.
曼尼 我知道你很兴奋 我也是
不过你有点兴奋过头了

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.382
Okay, okay!
好啦 你口气越来越像迭戈了

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:02.051
Boy, you're starting to sound like Diego.
好啦 你口气越来越像迭戈了

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:04.053
Hey, wait a second.
等等 迭戈呢？

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:06.264
Where is Diego?
等等 迭戈呢？

00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:08.599
(rustling)

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:15.315
(low growling)

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.321
-(roars)
-(screams)

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:25.491
-(grunts, pants)
-(roaring)

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:30.330
(distorted huffing)

00:05:31.706 --> 00:05:34.584
(distorted growling)

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:37.128
(gruff panting)

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:42.216
-(frightened panting)
-(roars)

00:05:43.468 --> 00:05:45.011
(gruff panting)

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.556
(whimpering)

00:05:48.639 --> 00:05:51.434
(heart beating loudly, panting)

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:54.562
(gasping for air)

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.940
(mocking laughter)

00:05:58.024 --> 00:06:00.109
-(labored breathing)
-Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh!

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:02.320
Whoo! My hooves are burning, baby!
我的蹄好烫 烫死啦！

00:06:02.403 --> 00:06:04.322
They are burning!
(laughs)
我的蹄好烫 烫死啦！

00:06:04.405 --> 00:06:05.406
Oh, look at this.
你看 我得踮脚尖走路！

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.908
I gotta tiptoe.
I gotta tiptoe.
你看 我得踮脚尖走路！

00:06:06.991 --> 00:06:08.493
Eat my dust, dingo!
吃我的沙子吧！

00:06:08.576 --> 00:06:09.869
(laughing)
吃我的沙子吧！

00:06:09.952 --> 00:06:11.579
(panting)

00:06:11.662 --> 00:06:12.955
ELLIE: Now?
好了吗？我现在能看了吗？

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:14.791
(impatient grunt)
Can I look now?
好了吗？我现在能看了吗？

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:15.958
MANNY: Easy.
好了 别吓坏宝宝

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:17.502
Don't freak out the baby.
好了 别吓坏宝宝

00:06:17.585 --> 00:06:19.128
The baby's fine.
宝宝很好 爸爸吓坏才让我担心

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:20.963
It's the freaked-out daddy
I'm worried about.
宝宝很好 爸爸吓坏才让我担心

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:23.549
Ah-ah-ah, no peeking!
不准偷看！

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:25.843
Voilà!
你看！幼儿游乐场！

00:06:25.927 --> 00:06:27.595
Playground for junior.
你看！幼儿游乐场！

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:29.138
(sighs)

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:30.765
Wow.
哇塞

